    , message : Maybe String
    , details : List Proto.Any.Any
    }


{-| A tuple of name and values (ASCII) for a header or trailer entry.

[`message connectrpc.conformance.v1.Header`](Connectrpc-Conformance-V1-Header#descriptor)

